        <item>
            <title>1.0.4</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Adding and removing speakers works reliably.</strong> Changes now take a couple of seconds instead of a minute or more, and the checkbox updates the moment you click.</li>
<li><strong>Clearer Speakers page.</strong> The room the music is playing from is labeled, and the Done button matches the rest of the window.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
